    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract base class representing a view in the MVC pattern. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <computeroutput><ref refid="class_view" kindref="compound">View</ref></computeroutput> class is responsible for managing logs and providing human-readable titles for simulation <computeroutput>RunMode</computeroutput>s. Derived classes must implement methods to handle normal and error log messages.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Responsibilities</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Maintain a reference to the associated <computeroutput><ref refid="class_model" kindref="compound">Model</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Provide mapping from <computeroutput>RunMode</computeroutput> enum values to string titles.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Provide logging interface for normal and error messages. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
